    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Desteği \u003e Yazılım \u0026 Özellikler",
    "content": "Giriş Explorer, oturumlar tarafından organize edilen video kayıtlarını tarama, seçme ve yönetme için bir arayüz sağlar. Bu belge, 25.3 ve daha yeni sürümlerde Explorer’ın tüm özelliklerini etkili bir şekilde kullanmayı ve gezinmeyi açıklar.\nGenel Bakış Toolbar: Toolbar with buttons for quick access to all the core functionality of the explorer.\nUser list: List of registered users with quality of life features such as a search bar and a sort button.\nDownloadable content list: List of downloaded recordings, such as Tour Swings.\nSessions and Recordings: List of sessions that can be expanded to display all recordings for that session.\nPreview recording: Preview window showing an animated thumbnail and key information about the recording.\nExport list: Drag and drop recordings here to add them to the export list. Recordings can then be exported as a Take file that enables the recording to be imported into Swing Catalyst later, or as raw data TSV files for custom analysis.\nKeyboard Navigation\nThe Explorer supports full keyboard navigation through the recording thumbnails:\nArrow Key Navigation ↑ - Move up one row\n↓ - Move down one row\n← - Move left one column\n→ - Move right one column\nPage Navigation Home - Jump to first item in current session\nEnd - Jump to last item in current session\nPage Up - Move up by visible page\nPage Down - Move down by visible page\nCross-Session Navigation When at the top/bottom of a session, arrow keys automatically navigate to adjacent sessions\nSessions will auto-expand when navigating into them\nSelection Behavior The Explorer implements standard multi-selection capabilities:\nSingle Selection Click - Select a single recording\nDouble-click - Open the selected recording for viewing\nMulti-Selection with Mouse Ctrl** + Click** - Toggle selection of individual items\nShift** + Click** - Select range from last selected item to clicked item\nMulti-Selection with Keyboard Shift** + Arrow Keys** - Extend selection in the direction of navigation\nCtrl** + Arrow Keys** - Navigate without changing selection\nCtrl** + **A - Select all visible recordings in the explorer\nCtrl** + Shift + **A - Select all visible recordings in the current session\nEscape - Clear visible selections\nSelection Information Selection Counter: Shows total selected count and visible selected count\nHidden Selections: Indicates when items are selected in collapsed or filtered sessions\nVisual Feedback: Selected items are highlighted with a border\nMenus and Context Actions Recording Context Menu Right-click on any recording to access:\nOpen - Open the recording\nAdd to Stack - Add to the analysis stack for quick access in Analysis Mode\nAdd to Export - Add to export queue\nDelete - Remove the recording\nUpload to Online - Share via SwingCatalyst Online\nStudent/Group Context Menu Right-click on student names to:\nAdd User to Export List - Include all user recordings in export\nDelete User - Remove the user and all their recordings\nGlobal Commands Available through keyboard shortcuts:\nEnter- Open selected recording(s).\nDelete - Delete all selected recordings\nCtrl** + **A - Select all visible recordings in the explorer\nCtrl** + Shift + **A - Select all recordings in current session\nEscape - Clear current selection\nDrag and Drop Dragging Takes Drag takes to drop zones\nVisual feedback shows drag adorner with recording thumbnail\nDrop indicators highlight valid drop targets\nDrop Zones **Viewport A/B drop zone **- Drop here to open recording(s) in either viewport A or B\n**Export list drop zone **- Drop here to add recording(s) to export queue\nTips for Efficient Use Bulk Operations: Use multi-selection to perform actions on multiple recordings simultaneously\nKeyboard Efficiency: Combine Ctrl, Shift, and arrow keys for rapid selection workflows\nContext Awareness: Right-click menus provide context-appropriate actions\nVisual Feedback: Pay attention to selection counters and highlight indicators\nThe Explorer is designed for efficient workflow management, allowing you to quickly navigate large collections of recordings and perform bulk operations with minimal effort.\nLast updated: 2026-01-06 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Gezgin, oturumlar tarafından organize edilen video kayıtlarına göz atmak, seçmek ve yönetmek için bir arayüz sağlar. Bu belge, etkili bir şekilde nasıl kullanılacağını kapsamaktadır...",
