    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Desteği \u003e Donanım",
    "content": "Bu makale, golf topunun vurulduğu zaman kaydı otomatik olarak tetiklemek için bir TrackMan, FlightScope veya ForeSight fırlatma monitörünün nasıl kullanılacağını açıklamaktadır. Bu, alanda rüzgar veya yakındaki golfçüler gibi çok ses olduğunda bir mikrofon kullanmanın iyi bir alternatifidir.\nUygulandığı Sürümler Swing Catalyst 4.5 ve sonrası\nİlgili Konular How to setup trigger microphone Solution Start Swing Catalyst and open Hardware settings from the settings menu\nMake sure you have connected your launch monitor device to the computer\nMake sure the the launch monitor software is running*\nUnder Launch Monitor check the Enabled box to start registering ball and **club data from the launch monitor\nCheck Use as trigger to automatically trigger video recordings when a shot is registered\nSwing Catalyst will now automatically trigger a video recording every time a shot is registered.\n** Foresight can be used without the Foresight simulator software running. Please see the corresponding support article for how to use Foresight with Swing Catalyst.*\n**Not all devices support club data (also depending on mode).\nMake sure launch monitor is enabled and used as a trigger.\nCertain launch monitors have more delay than others in processing data. This can be compensated for by selecting the “Configuration” drop down, and adding delay in milliseconds to compensate for.\nE.g. 1500 ms is a good value to try.\nLast updated: 2024-04-24 | View on official support site",
