    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Desteği \u003e Yazılım \u0026 Özellikler",
    "content": "Swing Catalyst Hareket Yakalama (MoCap) Bileşenleri Kurulum Kılavuzu Önemli Bildirim This feature requires a specific license type. Please check our FAQ for licensing details.\nIf you have received a self contained version for testing, you do not need to install any additional components.\nQuick Links Motion Capture FAQ\nMotion Capture Settings Guide\nSystem Requirements\nLens Distortion Correction Guide\nOverview This guide walks you through installing the necessary components to optimize Swing Catalyst Motion Capture performance. These components are specifically required for CUDA and TensorRT execution providers. Note that DirectML users can skip this installation as no additional components are required.\nSystem Requirements License Requirements Valid Swing Catalyst license with Motion Capture functionality\nStorage Requirements Minimum 5.9 GB free space on C: drive\nHardware Requirements NVIDIA graphics card supporting CUDA or TensorRT (GeForce or RTX series GPU), such as:\nNVIDIA RTX 3070, 3080, 3090 series (minimum 6GB VRAM)\nNVIDIA RTX 4060, 4070, 4080, 4090\nNVIDIA RTX 5070, 5080, 5090\nOther NVIDIA graphics cards may work as well.\nInstallation Process (Swing Catalyst 25.2 or newer) Step 1: Start Swing Catalyst Go to Settings -\u003e Video \u0026 Capture\nIn the Motion Capture section, select TensorRT.\nClick the Download button.\nStep 2: Compiling the engine Once the download is finished it will load TensorRT which may take a few minutes, wait for it to complete (the spinner indicator on the MoCap button will disappear).\nWhen completed go to capture mode and make a recording, this will make the TensorRT engine compile and optimize itself for your hardware. This process may take around 10-15 minutes depending on hardware.\nInstallation Process (Swing Catalyst 25.1 only) Step 1: Download Required Components Step 2: Run downloaded installer Run the installer file\nNavigate to your downloads directory and run the installer file\nClick “Install” Install the components\nFollow the on-screen instructions\nThe components installer will install the necessary components in the C:\\ProgramData\\Swing Catalyst\\components directory Installation Reference The components should now be installed.\nTo remove the components you can uninstall them from “Installed Apps” in the Windows Settings.\nLast updated: 2025-05-19 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Bu özellik belirli bir lisans türü gerektirir. Lisanslama ayrıntıları için lütfen SSS bölümümüzü kontrol edin.",
